### Obtener información de puntos de una ejecución — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/getExecutionInformation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/getExecutionInformation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workplanExecutionId": 1
}

### Body inválido (workplanExecutionId no numérico) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/getExecutionInformation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workplanExecutionId": "no-es-numero"
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 200 con lista vacía
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/getExecutionInformation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workplanExecutionId": 999999999
}
